---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import SectionHeader from "../components/SectionHeader.astro";
import CTASection from "../components/CTASection.astro";
import TestimonialSpotlight from "../components/TestimonialSpotlight.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
import { TESTIMONIALS } from "../data/testimonials";

const pillars = [
  {
    title: "Yoga",
    description: "Developing flexibility, mobility, balance, stability and body awareness through structured Yogasana practice.",
  },
  {
    title: "Pranayama",
    description: "Cultivating breath awareness, focus and self-regulation.",
  },
  {
    title: "Quantified Nutrition",
    description: "Applying evidence-based nutrition principles to support sustainable fat loss, nourishment and body recomposition.",
  },
  {
    title: "Progressive Strength Training",
    description: "Building lean muscle, functional strength and physical resilience through structured resistance training.",
  },
];
---

<Layout
  title={`About ${site.founderName} | ${site.brandName}`}
  description={`Meet ${site.founderName}, ${site.founderTitle} at ${site.brandName}: the story behind ${site.methodName}.`}
  pageUrl="https://auraandolives.com/about/"
  ogImage="https://auraandolives.com/assets/images/og/about-og.webp"
>
  <section
    class="hero-bg hero-photo-bg about-hero pt-28 pb-16 sm:pt-36 sm:pb-20"
    style="--hero-image: url('/assets/images/heroes/about-hero.webp'); --hero-position: center 25%;"
  >
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center">
      <div
        class="fade-in inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-5 rounded-full border border-gold-400/30 bg-gold-400/10 px-4 py-1.5"
      >
        <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold-400"></span>
        <span class="text-xs font-600 tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-gold-300"
          >About {site.founderName}</span
        >
      </div>
      <h1
        class="fade-in font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-800 leading-[1.1] text-cream-50"
      >
        A Wellness Coach on a Mission
      </h1>
      <p
        class="fade-in mt-6 text-cream-200/85 leading-relaxed text-base sm:text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto"
      >
        Inspired by my own journey, I help others rediscover their strength,
        build confidence and nurture their overall wellbeing.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-cream-50">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div
        class="fade-in aspect-video w-full rounded-[2rem] border border-forest-900/10 shadow-soft mb-12 overflow-hidden"
      >
        <img
          src="/assets/images/founder/about-story.webp"
          alt="Reshma guiding a mindful studio practice with her community."
          width="1440"
          height="810"
          class="photo-frame-image"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="fade-in">
        <SectionHeader
          eyebrow="My Story"
          title="From personal struggles to a purposeful journey"
          align="left"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="fade-in mt-8 space-y-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-forest-800">
        <p class="font-display text-xl leading-relaxed text-forest-950">
          My relationship with fitness has not always been easy.
        </p>
        <p>
          Growing up with obesity and experiencing body-shaming affected my
          confidence and often kept me away from activities I genuinely loved,
          including Indian classical dance, yoga and other physical pursuits.
        </p>
        <p>
          Later, motherhood brought its own physical challenges. Post-delivery
          pelvic discomfort and health concerns during my pregnancies made me
          realise how easily women can put their own wellbeing aside while
          navigating life's responsibilities.
        </p>
        <p>
          These experiences changed my perspective. I began to understand that
          fitness is not merely about appearance or weight. It is about feeling
          strong, capable, mobile and confident in your own body.
        </p>
        <p>
          My journey of rediscovering movement, embracing yoga and
          incorporating strength training and mindful nutrition gradually
          became much more than a personal pursuit. It became my calling.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-forest-950 py-20 text-cream-50 sm:py-28">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:gap-20">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-600 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gold-400">A foundation of discipline</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl font-700 leading-tight sm:text-4xl">
          From the corporate world to health &amp; wellness
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-cream-200/85">
        <p>
          Armed with professional qualifications as a Company Secretary and a
          Master's degree in Business Law, I spent 23 years in the corporate
          world before choosing to transition into a profession that truly
          resonated with my passion and purpose.
        </p>
        <p>
          Today, as a Healthpreneur, Certified Yoga Therapist and Certified
          Nutrition &amp; Fitness Coach, I bring together the discipline,
          structured thinking and practical problem-solving skills of my
          corporate experience with my passion for yoga and contemporary
          fitness science.
        </p>
        <dl class="grid gap-0 border-y border-cream-50/15 sm:grid-cols-3">
          <div class="border-b border-cream-50/15 py-5 sm:border-b-0 sm:border-r sm:pr-5">
            <dt class="text-xs font-600 uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-gold-400">Qualification</dt>
            <dd class="mt-2 font-display text-lg text-cream-50">Company Secretary</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="border-b border-cream-50/15 py-5 sm:border-b-0 sm:border-r sm:px-5">
            <dt class="text-xs font-600 uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-gold-400">Education</dt>
            <dd class="mt-2 font-display text-lg text-cream-50">Master's in Business Law</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="py-5 sm:pl-5">
            <dt class="text-xs font-600 uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-gold-400">Experience</dt>
            <dd class="mt-2 font-display text-lg text-cream-50">23 years in corporate</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-cream-100 py-20 sm:py-28">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 sm:px-6">
      <SectionHeader
        eyebrow="My Mission"
        title={site.methodName}
        description="I work with yoga aspirants, enthusiasts, aspiring yoga teachers and yoga teachers who want to take their fitness journey further."
      />
      <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-3xl text-center leading-relaxed text-forest-700">
        Whether your goal is to improve mobility, build functional strength,
        address excess body fat, improve body composition or progress
        confidently in your yoga practice, my approach brings together four
        complementary pillars.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-14 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-forest-900/10 bg-forest-900/10 sm:grid-cols-2">
        {
          pillars.map((pillar, index) => (
            <div class="fade-in bg-cream-50 p-7 sm:p-8">
              <span class="font-display text-2xl font-700 text-gold-500">
                {String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0")}
              </span>
              <h3 class="mt-5 font-display text-xl font-700 text-forest-950">
                {pillar.title}
              </h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-forest-700">
                {pillar.description}
              </p>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-10 max-w-3xl text-center text-lg leading-relaxed text-forest-800">
        The objective is not simply to practise more or weigh less. It is to
        build a body that feels stronger, moves better and supports you through
        every stage of life.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <TestimonialSpotlight
    testimonial={TESTIMONIALS[2]}
    eyebrow="Seen by her clients"
    title="A coach who builds confidence"
  />

  <section class="bg-cream-50 py-20 sm:py-28">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6">
      <SectionHeader
        eyebrow="My Teaching Philosophy"
        title="Precise guidance, rooted in empathy"
        align="left"
      />
      <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-forest-800">
        <p>
          I believe that sustainable transformation requires more than
          motivation. It requires the right knowledge, an individualised
          approach, consistency and a method that works with real-life
          responsibilities.
        </p>
        <p>
          My teaching style is energetic, therapeutic and technically precise.
          I value correct alignment, mindful movement, individual capabilities
          and progressive development, while ensuring that relaxation and
          recovery remain integral to the practice.
        </p>
        <p>
          Inspired by the teachings of B.K.S. Iyengar and T. Krishnamacharya, I
          seek to bridge classical yogic wisdom with contemporary understanding
          of anatomy, biomechanics, exercise science and nutrition.
        </p>
        <p>
          Above all, I believe in teaching with empathy, integrity and
          humility. Every individual's starting point is different, and every
          transformation deserves patience, respect and encouragement.
        </p>
      </div>
      <blockquote class="mt-12 border-l-2 border-gold-500 pl-6 font-display text-2xl leading-relaxed text-forest-950 sm:text-3xl">
        Your starting point does not define your potential.
      </blockquote>
      <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-forest-800">
        My mission is to help you discover what your body is capable of with
        the right guidance, knowledge and consistent effort. Welcome to Aura
        &amp; Olives. Wellness redefined.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTASection
    context={`getting to know ${site.founderName}`}
    title="Let's start your transformation story."
    description="Message Reshma directly. Every reply is personal, never a bot."
  />
</Layout>
